# deploy/.env - read by docker-compose.yml (env_file). Copy this file to
# deploy/.env on the server and fill in the values there. Never commit .env,
# never put a secret in the image or in docker-compose.yml, never paste one
# into a shell command line.
#
# Permissions: chmod 600 deploy/.env
# Format: KEY=value, no quotes, no spaces around "=".
#
# Meta model API key. Leave empty to run with the model step disabled
# (the rest of the analysis still works).
MODEL_API_KEY=
#
# Optional. Enables completion webhooks (notify_url) and is the HMAC key of
# json deliveries. At least 32 characters, or the server does not start; for
# example the output of `openssl rand -hex 32`. Left out or empty, webhooks
# are disabled and any notify_url gets 400 webhooks_disabled. Receivers need
# the same value to check signatures. See deploy/README.md, step 2.
# WEBHOOK_SECRET=
